    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instagram token refresh\nInstagram-Login tokens last 60 days and can be refreshed any time after 24 h. This runs monthly, refreshes, and emails the new token. The refreshed token replaces the old one server-side, so the credential in n8n must be updated by hand from the email - the old value stops working at its original expiry.",
